 "content": "다음 식을 간단히 하시오.\n⑴ $18b^{5}\\div 6b^{2}$\n⑵ $4a^{3}\\div\\frac{1}{5}a$\n⑶ $-x^{3}y^{6}\\div 3x^{5}y^{2}$\n⑷ $(x^{3}y)^{2}\\div\\left(-\\frac{2y^{2}}{x}\\right)^{3}$",
 "choices": [],
 "answer": "⑴ $3b^{3}$ ⑵ $20a^{2}$ ⑶ $-\\frac{y^{4}}{3x^{2}}$ ⑷ $-\\frac{x^{9}}{8y^{4}}$",
 "solution": "⑴ $\\frac{18b^{5}}{6b^{2}}=3b^{3}$ ⑵ $4a^{3}\\times\\frac{5}{a}=20a^{2}$ ⑶ $-\\frac{x^{3}y^{6}}{3x^{5}y^{2}}=-\\frac{y^{4}}{3x^{2}}$ ⑷ $x^{6}y^{2}\\div\\left(-\\frac{8y^{6}}{x^{3}}\\right)=x^{6}y^{2}\\times\\left(-\\frac{x^{3}}{8y^{6}}\\right)=-\\frac{x^{9}}{8y^{4}}$",
